# Test engine

## Step order (`TestFlowPage`)

`form` → `prep` → `spaceCheck` → `audioCheck` → `guide` → `countdown` → `practiceRun` → `brief` → `countdown` → `run` → `thanks`.

- Psychologist `form`: search client, do not dump full list.
- `practiceRun` uses `getPracticeProfile()` — never `saveTestSession`.
- `run` → `onDone` → `computeReportMetrics` (V4) → `complete_test_session` + PDF persist.

## Profiles (`profiles.js`)

- `child` 13 min / late 1000; `teen` 15 / 900; `adult` 15 / 800.
- Section labels are Turkish and consumed by `report/phaseBuckets.js`. Renaming breaks PDF phase charts and audit buckets.

## Distractors

- Schedules via `distractorSchedule.js` + `distractors/silent|combined`.
- Keep GIF/sound caps consistent with existing engine comments.
- `testQaMode.js` flags must stay `false` unless the human is doing a local QA session and will revert.

## Logging

- Trial logs + `pressTimeline` (idle for H). Do not drop timeline fields without updating H + audit.
- Determinism: `random.js` seed/behavior affects reproducibility — change deliberately.
